dowed mode now stays within the usable desktop area so it does not cover the taskbar.Oversized windows are automatically maximized to fit the screen.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T13:18:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697456","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:26:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5071650-1841579228667430","game_id":"steam-5071650","kind":"update","title":"DaiDee 大弟 Demo Update 2","summary":"Four-of-a-kind now correctly requires four matching cards plus one extra card.The game properly rejects four-of-a-kind without the extra card.Computer players and scoring understand the corrected combination.Style descriptions and tutorials now show the correct rules.Pausing now prevents cards, buttons, and other gameplay actions from responding.Closing a menu no longer clears selected cards.Shop buttons no longer overlap.Several untranslated or incorrectly formatted UI labels were fixed.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T03:18:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667430","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:26:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5071650-1841579228664196","game_id":"steam-5071650","kind":"update","title":"DaiDee 大弟 Demo Update 1","summary":"Added 2s card hover tooltip to explain usageClicking on the sort button will cycle through various sorting such as pairs etc..","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T02:53:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228664196","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:26:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5071